WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.300
Fuzz this project: oxfuzz picks decode_utf8, the AI drafts a libFuzzer harness, and the sandbox compiles and smoke-tests it.

2
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:22.000
The drafted harness cannot run until a person reviews and approves it.

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Smoke-test evidence and an independent model review; the smoke test already hit a crash (sped up 1.5x).

4
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.000
A person approves the harness, and a one-minute run starts in the sandbox.

5
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:59.000
libFuzzer stops at its first crash, so this run ends early (sped up 3x).

6
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:13.333
Run finished: one crash artifact retained for review (sped up 1.5x).

7
00:01:13.333 --> 00:01:35.833
Triage: Scan for Crashes replays and classifies the crash in the sandbox, with no AI call.

8
00:01:35.833 --> 00:01:59.833
heap-buffer-overflow (read) at utf8.c:31 with the AddressSanitizer stack; not called exploitable until reviewed.
